[gd_resource type="Theme" load_steps=11 format=3]

[ext_resource type="FontFile" path="res://assets/ui/fonts/kenney_future.ttf" id="1_font"]

; The teal/dark HUD-and-menu theme built on `scripts/ui/ui_tokens.gd`
; (`docs/decisions/D28`).
;
; Structurally the same shape as `scenes/ui/menu_theme.tres` — same
; sub-resource names, same Theme entries — recoloured to the token palette
; and reworked for one thing menu_theme.tres cannot do: FOCUS IS TEAL HERE,
; not gold. Spec §17 retires the gold focus ring; `btn_focus` below is a 2px
; `TEAL` border over a fill ~6% brighter than `btn_normal`, still the
; loudest state in the theme, just not the warm one `build_theme.tres`
; reserves for build/craft surfaces.
;
; Nothing in the live game points at this file yet (`D28`) — it exists and
; loads, and a follow-on item swaps scenes onto it one at a time.

